{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2022-03-28 08:00:00', 'title': '505 SOUTHWESTERN® FLAME ROASTED GREEN CHILE TO BE SOLD IN WALMART STORES ACROSS U.S.', 'text': "ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. & GREENWOOD VILLAGE, COLO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #HOWDOYOU505--505 SOUTHWESTERN®, THE COUNTRY'S LEADING HATCH VALLEY FLAMED ROASTED GREEN CHILE BRAND, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS PREMIUM PRODUCTS, INCLUDING ITS FLAGSHIP JARRED FLAME ROASTED GREEN CHILE PRODUCT, WILL BE SOLD IN ALMOST ALL WALMART STORES IN THE UNITED STATES. ROLLING OUT OVER THE NEXT SEVERAL MONTHS, CONSUMERS SERVED BY ALL 4,461 WALMART LOCATIONS ACROSS THE COUNTRY WILL BE ABLE TO PURCHASE 505SW™ AT THEIR LOCAL STORE, AS WELL AS ON"}